<em><a href="https://youtu.be/1GL9l1DXTsQ">YOU'RE FIT TO LEARN THE PROPER MEANING OF A-</a></em></p>
</div>
<hr />
<p>I like to say that all of my articles are incredibly personal, but I think this one is a bit beyond my other ones. As much as I like criticizing the systems around me, it's nice to look inward and rationalize the unpleasant things staring back at me.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
