<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Tag policy disallows the tagging of entities that are not directly referenced in the work proper. I never believed Mekhane was too much of a &quot;naturally-occuring&quot; god, anyways.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/n-aepic-fael" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4463776); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4463776&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1591582807" alt="N_Aepic_Fael" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4463776)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/n-aepic-fael" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4463776); return false;">N_Aepic_Fael</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gee0765" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5376871); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5376871&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1591582807" alt="gee0765" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5376871)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gee0765" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5376871); return false;">gee0765</a></span> for looking this over!</p>
